cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If RenderPilot helps you, please cite it."
title: "RenderPilot — Manage and swap DLSS, FSR, XeSS and HDR in PC games"
abstract: >-
  Local-first Windows app to manage, update and swap DLSS, FSR, XeSS,
  DirectStorage upscaler libraries and NVIDIA driver presets across PC games,
  with one-click HDR via the RenoDX ReShade add-on. Built with Tauri 2,
  Svelte 5 and Rust.
authors:
